	measure 'Dat_Bed_Days Bed Days per Person (ICB)' = ```
			
			
			CALCULATE(
			    [Dat_Bed_Days Total Bed Days],
			    ALL('Ref_GP_Primary'),
			    ALL('Ref_Age')
			)
			 / 
			 CALCULATE(
			    [Dat_Bed_Days Distinct Individuals],
			    ALL('Ref_GP_Primary'),
			    ALL('Ref_Age')
			)
			
			```
